-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ## B. Implementing Access Controls
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC In this section, we decode the requirements and implement access control at the level of catalogs, schemas and tables to satisfy the requirements set forth in the previous section.

