-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ### B1. Requirement ID 001
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC This requirement calls for read-only (`SELECT`) for all tables in the `law_prd.traffic` schema. We can leverage privilege inheritance to achieve this by applying the `SELECT` grant at the schema level, where it automatically propagates down to any tables or views within the schema.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Note that we also need to apply the prerequisite `USE CATALOG` and `USE SCHEMA` grants at the catalog and schema levels.
