-- COMMAND ----------

-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ### B2. Requirement ID 002
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC This requirement calls for full admin capabilities of all objects. While `ALL PRIVILEGES` provides a complete set of conventional privileges, it does not provide ownership-like capabilities that allow you to:
-- MAGIC - manage grants
-- MAGIC - reassign ownership
-- MAGIC - drop/delete the object
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC `MANAGE` provides these ability and, combined with `ALL PRIVILEGES`, is the correct interpretation of "admin capabilities" in this context.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Note also that the requirement states to extend this  to all objects and all schemas. Once again leveraging privilege inheritance, we apply the grants, this time at the catalog level, where it automatically propagates down to any current (or future) schemas and their descendants.
-- MAGIC
