-- MAGIC We can interactively apply this in the Catalog Explorer user interface, or achieve it using the following SQL statement:
-- MAGIC <div class="code-block" data-language="sql">
-- MAGIC GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES,MANAGE ON CATALOG `law_prd` TO `admin`;
-- MAGIC </div>
