-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ### B4. Requirement ID 004
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC This requirement calls for a very specific privilege: ability to  write (but not read) the `traffic_events` table, for the _le_app_ principal.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC In this case, we should not leverage inheritance, but rather adhere to the least privilege approach by explicitly granting the minimal privileges needed to fulfill the requirement:
-- MAGIC - `USE CATALOG` on the containing catalog
-- MAGIC - `USE SCHEMA` on the containing schema
-- MAGIC - `MODIFY` on the desired table
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC <div style="display:flex; justify-content:center;">
