-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC We can interactively apply this in the Catalog Explorer user interface, or achieve it using the following SQL statements:
-- MAGIC <div class="code-block" data-language="sql">
-- MAGIC GRANT USE CATALOG ON CATALOG `law_prd` TO `public_app`;
-- MAGIC GRANT USE SCHEMA,SELECT ON SCHEMA `law_prd`.`traffic` TO `public_app`;
-- MAGIC </div>
-- MAGIC
